# techtree.pdl - what a pet can ask to learn. NODE | id | title | needs (comma separated node ids, - for none). A node is open when every need has an ACCEPTED lesson card for this pet.
NODE | counting | counting small numbers | -
NODE | colors | colors of things | -
NODE | animals | farm animals | -
NODE | weather | weather and the sky | -
NODE | coins | coins and prices | counting
NODE | shapes | simple shapes | colors
NODE | plants | how plants grow | animals
NODE | farming | farming crops | plants
NODE | trading | trading fairly | coins
NODE | cooking | cooking food | farming
NODE | building | building a house | trading
NODE | maps | reading maps | shapes
